{"title":"죠죠 ~그 피의 운명~","artist":"타나카 코헤이","sourceId":"reference:oidnNwPYLKHX1nYNxpT4","sourceHash":"46c7fa55540f1e82a7be94718b89b830849196b1d5f486caa370801e60266cdd","performanceStatus":"no_performance_record","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":16.86,"end":19.86,"text":"空 こぼれ落ちたふたつの星が","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":23.05,"end":26.05,"text":"光と闇の水面 吸い込まれてゆく","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":29.7,"end":32.7,"text":"引き合うように 重なる波紋","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":39.76,"end":42.76,"text":"誇りの道を往く者に 太陽の導きを","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":46.2,"end":49.2,"text":"野望の果てを目指す者に 生贄を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":59.79,"end":61.26,"text":"震えるほど心","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":61.26,"end":64.25999999999999,"text":"燃え尽きるほど熱く","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":64.58,"end":67.58,"text":"その手から放て 鼓動","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":67.77,"end":70.77,"text":"身体 漲る勇気で","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":71.22,"end":74.22,"text":"迷い無き覚悟に喝采を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":77.72,"end":80.72,"text":"その血の運命 ジョジョ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":110.57,"end":113.57,"text":"賽は投げられた 進むしかない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":116.86,"end":119.86,"text":"奇妙な螺旋の中 転がり続ける","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":123.44,"end":126.44,"text":"永遠を彷徨う冒険者","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":133.36,"end":136.36,"text":"恐怖を認め 克つ者に 黄金の魂を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":139.81,"end":142.81,"text":"そして出会った 二人のために... 戦いを","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":153.36,"end":154.88,"text":"幕が開いたようだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":154.88,"end":157.88,"text":"終わりなき物語","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":158.17000000000002,"end":161.17000000000002,"text":"命がぶつかる火花","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":161.55,"end":164.55,"text":"青春の日々を照らせよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":164.93,"end":167.93,"text":"君という未来に幸運を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":171.44,"end":174.44,"text":"その血の運命 ジョジョ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":184.5,"end":187.5,"text":"二度とほどけない 絡み合った運命","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":194.48,"end":197.48,"text":"すべてはここから始まっていたのさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":205.74,"end":207.59,"text":"震えるほど心","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":207.59,"end":210.59,"text":"燃え尽きるほど熱く","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":210.63,"end":213.63,"text":"その手から放て 鼓動","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":214.07999999999998,"end":217.07999999999998,"text":"身体 漲る勇気で","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":217.51,"end":220.51,"text":"迷い無き覚悟に喝采を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":222.16,"end":223.95,"text":"幕が開いたようだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":223.95,"end":226.95,"text":"終わりなき物語","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":227.26,"end":230.26,"text":"命がぶつかる火花","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":230.52,"end":233.52,"text":"青春の日々を照らせよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":233.95,"end":236.95,"text":"君という未来に幸運を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":240.53,"end":243.53,"text":"その血の運命 ジョジョ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}